because they're shy,

00:03:02.232 --> 00:03:04.035
and they just found another way to stand.

00:03:04.035 --> 00:03:06.709
So again, if sales is your
thing, it's your forte,

00:03:06.709 --> 00:03:09.565
or something that you want
to focus on and be great at,

00:03:09.565 --> 00:03:11.615
then go for it because it's
definitely a great way to do it,

00:03:11.615 --> 00:03:13.506
but again, it's not the only way.

00:03:13.506 --> 00:03:15.024
When I took over this business,

00:03:15.024 --> 00:03:17.200
Toronto Dance Salsa, I sat down with Alex.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.543
We looked at ten different
ways to grow this business,

00:03:19.543 --> 00:03:22.832
and I had him pick the
two that he really wanted

00:03:22.832 --> 00:03:24.924
to focus on, and I gave him one which is

00:03:24.924 --> 00:03:26.403
be thought leader and then okay,

00:03:26.403 --> 00:03:27.758
pick the one you want to focus on.

00:03:27.758 --> 00:03:28.914
Is it going to be, one of them was sales.

00:03:28.914 --> 00:03:31.531
One of them was, okay, let's
go and start selling people,

00:03:31.531 --> 00:03:35.073
start making partnerships with
different businesses and say,

00:03:35.073 --> 00:03:37.252
"Hey, how do we have these
alliance things workout where"

00:03:37.252 --> 00:03:39.469
"you can promote out
classes to your customers,"

00:03:39.469 --> 00:03:42.016
"and we find some kind of
arrangement to make it work out."

00:03:42.016 --> 00:03:43.744
He focused on something else.

00:03:43.744 --> 00:03:46.950
He wanted to focus on providing
a great customer experience.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.000
That's one way to stand.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.303
If you provide a fantastic
customer experience

00:03:51.303 --> 00:03:54.709
they will come back and they
will tell their friends,

00:03:54.709 --> 00:03:57.749
and Alex came from a sales
background at a different job

00:03:57.749 --> 00:04:00.046
so my initial thinking was
okay, we're going to have

00:04:00.046 --> 00:04:01.691
a salesman come in and go and sell,

00:04:01.691 --> 00:04:04.405
and it switched to okay,
we're going to focus on having

00:04:04.405 --> 00:04:05.807
a great customer experience.

00:04:05.807 --> 00:04:06.856
Because they're going
to tell their friends,

00:04:06.856 --> 00:04:08.908
and they're going to come
back and be repeat buyers.

00:04:08.908 --> 00:04:10.261
So that's another way to stand.

00:04:10.261 --> 00:04:12.031
It could be you provide great marketing.

00:04:12.031 --> 00:04:14.414
It could be you build a team,

00:04:14.414 --> 00:04:15.480
and you allow the people underneath

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.369
you to bring their skills in.

00:04:17.369 --> 00:04:18.643
It could be you're doing a thought leader.

00:04:18.643 --> 00:04:20.622
It could be going through PR,

00:04:20.622 --> 00:04:22.269
could be going through influencers.

00:04:22.269 --> 00:04:23.792
It doesn't have to be the traditional

00:04:23.792 --> 00:04:25.355
hardcore sales approach.

00:04:25.355 --> 00:04:27.644
Now the one thing that
all of these things have

00:04:27.644 --> 00:04:29.491
in common that if you want to have success

00:04:29.491 --> 00:04:31.585
as an entrepreneur and
be a leader you're going

00:04:31.585 --> 00:04:34.076
to have to figure out is
how to connect with people,

00:04:34.076 --> 00:04:37.035
and if you want to see sales
as connecting with people

00:04:37.035 --> 00:04:38.635
I'm okay with that, it's just not

00:04:38.635 --> 00:04:42.802
the typical salesman
approach of I see that person

00:04:44.463 --> 00:04:48.335
as my next suit or as I've
got to hit my sales quota,

00:04:48.335 --> 00:04:51.093
and I'm going to force
them to buy this thing.

00:04:51.093 --> 00:04:53.068
A lot of times sales are
seen through that lens.

00:04:53.068 --> 00:04:56.120
If you see it as just
connecting with people

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.048
and helping them along their path,

00:04:58.048 --> 00:05:00.724
the difference for me is really doing

00:05:00.724 --> 00:05:03.429
the thing that is best for them.

00:05:03.429 --> 00:05:05.405
Where a lot of times in sales
you're just trying to hit

00:05:05.405 --> 00:05:07.792
your quota, you're just
trying to reach your market,

00:05:07.792 --> 00:05:10.747
trying to push the customer
past their comfort zone so

00:05:10.747 --> 00:05:12.714
you can meet your sales quota so

00:05:12.714 --> 00:05:14.724
it's a very selfish
perspective as opposed to

00:05:14.724 --> 00:05:17.282
this is actually what's best for them,

00:05:17.282 --> 00:05:18.393
but if you want to form alliances,

00:05:18.393 --> 00:05:19.665
if you want to talk to the media,

00:05:19.665 --> 00:05:20.776
if you want to be a great leader,

00:05:20.776 --> 00:05:22.094
if you want to be a thought leader,

00:05:22.094 --> 00:05:24.607
if you want to write great marketing copy,

00:05:24.607 --> 00:05:27.039
if you want to stand out on social media

00:05:27.039 --> 00:05:29.294
you have to be able to understand how

00:05:29.294 --> 00:05:31.188
to connect with people and move them

00:05:31.188 --> 00:05:34.105
to take action as in their best interest.

00:05:34.105 --> 00:05:36.820
I just want to let people
know that it's okay to be shy.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:39.653
If you are shy you can
have a lot of success

00:05:39.653 --> 00:05:41.463
as an entrepreneur, you
can have a lot of success

00:05:41.463 --> 00:05:43.145
in a lot of different fields.

00:05:43.145 --> 00:05:46.263
Ellen is an introvert which surprised me,

00:05:46.263 --> 00:05:49.674
but has the biggest talk show on TV.

00:05:49.674 --> 00:05:51.110
There's lots of different ways to stand.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:52.880
It's not that this is the only way

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.152
to have success as an entrepreneur.

00:05:55.152 --> 00:05:57.211
It works for some people,

00:05:57.211 --> 00:05:58.898
but it's not going to work for you,

00:05:58.898 --> 00:06:00.745
and the worst thing you can do,

00:06:00.745 --> 00:06:03.044
the worst thing you can do is say listen

00:06:03.044 --> 00:06:04.808
to somebody who doesn't look like you,

00:06:04.808 --> 00:06:06.494
who doesn't believe
the same things as you,

00:06:06.494 --> 00:06:08.631
