this is the only way to do it,

00:06:08.631 --> 00:06:10.603
and then feel like you can't measure up,

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:12.777
and you can't be like them,

00:06:12.777 --> 00:06:14.383
and so you'll never have success,

00:06:14.383 --> 00:06:15.407
and you'll try and try and try,

00:06:15.407 --> 00:06:17.669
but you'll never beat through because

00:06:17.669 --> 00:06:19.439
you're just not enough like them.

00:06:19.439 --> 00:06:21.122
Where the best thing you
can do is find someone

00:06:21.122 --> 00:06:22.356
who looks like you, find someone

00:06:22.356 --> 00:06:23.833
