be able to learn from them,

00:06:28.808 --> 00:06:31.851
and say they did it, they had
success as a shy entrepreneur,

00:06:31.851 --> 00:06:34.363
they had success as an
introverted entrepreneur

00:06:34.363 --> 00:06:37.317
so I can have it to,
and so wherever you draw

00:06:37.317 --> 00:06:41.268
the line between sales and being
able to connect with people

00:06:41.268 --> 00:06:43.776
because this is super,
super, super important,

00:06:43.776 --> 00:06:46.729
and if you see them as the
same thing that's great,

